# Performance-audit run output (generated benchmark artifacts, not source).
# Lighthouse/DevTools traces, HAR dumps, raw run data and experiment patches
# are large (~800MB) and regenerable — keep them local, out of the repo.
# Hand-written *.md summaries in reports/ stay tracked (not matched below).
reports/performance/**/raw/
reports/performance/**/lighthouse/
reports/performance/**/superseded/
reports/performance/**/after/
reports/performance/**/run-after/
reports/performance/**/run-after2/
reports/performance/**/run-control/
reports/performance/**/v-after/
reports/performance/**/v-control/
reports/performance/**/w-after/
reports/performance/**/w-after2/
reports/performance/**/w-control/
reports/performance/**/discarded-concurrent-runs/
reports/performance/**/discarded-network-outage-runs/
reports/performance/**/*.report.html
reports/performance/**/*.report.json
reports/performance/**/lighthouse-results.csv
